tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:66a8e72d2f903e6bc4e41916c90365c87d60a3f45f094315943eac2cd58bc136","file":"preprints/The-Grothendieck-homotopy-hypothesis-via-elementary-expansions-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","line":50,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"ca9d7922554e39a8e2babe99134c799b9abe29ef254c1fd4c91da7982ba1de9c","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/The-Grothendieck-homotopy-hypothesis-via-elementary-expansions-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:66a8e72d2f903e6bc4e41916c90365c87d60a3f45f094315943eac2cd58bc136","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-Grothendieck-homotopy-hypothesis-via-elementary-expansions-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex#L50"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFix any Grothendieck coherator \\(\\mathcal C\\).\nLet \\(X\\) be a cellular \\(\\mathcal C\\)-infinity-groupoid, let \\(n\\ge0\\),\nand let \\(a:D_n\\to X\\) be any cell.  In the pushout square\n\\[\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[baseline=(current bounding box.center),\n                   node distance=1.25cm and 2.2cm,>=Stealth]\n\\node (a) {\\(D_n\\)};\n\\node (b) [right=of a] {\\(D_{n+1}\\)};\n\\node (c) [below=of a] {\\(X\\)};\n\\node (d) at (b |- c) {\\(X^+\\)};\n\\draw[->] (a) -- node[above] {\\(s_n\\)} (b);\n\\draw[->] (a) -- node[left] {\\(a\\)} (c);\n\\draw[->] (b) -- (d);\n\\draw[->] (c) -- node[below] {\\(i\\)} (d);\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n\\]\nwhere \\(s_n\\) is the source inclusion, the map \\(i:X\\to X^+\\)\nis a weak equivalence."}
